DXX-Rebirth for the Raspberry Pi

Use a current distribution with Mesa graphics, SDL3 (3.2 or later),
SDL3_image, SDL3_mixer, PhysicsFS, SCons and a C++23 compiler.
See ../Documentation/building.md for dependency and compiler requirements.

Build with:
    scons raspberrypi=mesa

SDL3 owns the window, input and GL context. X11, Wayland and KMSDRM availability
depends on the SDL3 build and the system's graphics/session configuration.
OpenGL ES can be selected with opengles=1 where GLES1 development headers
and libraries are available.

raspberrypi=mesa is the supported Raspberry Pi graphics configuration.
raspberrypi=1 and the DispmanX/VideoCore overlay are not supported.
